title: "Basin-Guided-Phasing"
abstract: >-
  Staged computational pipeline for attenuated signed amplitudes, Basin Score
  calibration, controlled degradation, anti-phase MTZ generation, AutoBuild
  validation, and degradation-result analysis for basin-guided macromolecular
  phasing.
